# Weather with no user-supplied API key. Boots the app without any
# flash_seed, so read_config writes the placeholder defaults
# (api_key = "YOUR_ACCUWEATHER_API_KEY"). The new guard in
# get_location_key() must short-circuit before any HTTPClient::GET so
# the app survives without crashing and without spurious fixture hits.
#
# We don't screenshot — the rendered page-0 clock is intentionally
# excluded from the golden suite (see weather/smoke.scn).

app weather

wait_ms 800
assert_no_crash

action TURN_RIGHT
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
